@startuml l02-write-timing
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title 寫週期時序（照影片投影片畫）

scale 50 as 60 pixels

concise "Address" as ADDR
robust "RAS#" as RAS
RAS has High,Low
robust "CAS#" as CAS
CAS has High,Low
robust "WE#" as WE
WE has High,Low
concise "Data in" as DIN

@0
ADDR is {-}
RAS is High
CAS is High
WE is High
DIN is {-}

@20
ADDR is "row address"

@60
RAS is Low

@150
ADDR is "column address"
WE is Low
DIN is "data input"

@190
CAS is Low

@260
WE is High
DIN is {-}

@320
ADDR is {-}

@350
RAS is High

@400
CAS is High

@450

highlight 150 to 260 #FEF7E0 : WE# low：收資料

legend bottom
  1. row 位址先出現，RAS# 拉低 strobe 它
  2. column 位址出現的同時，WE# 拉低、輸入資料準備好
  3. CAS# 拉低 strobe column 位址 → demux 把新值寫進 sense amp
  4. WE# 放開，不再收資料
  5. 最後 RAS#、CAS# 放開
endlegend
@enduml
